  "body": "The `textarea` is a scroll container, even if 'overflow: visible' is set on it. But it also honors other values of 'overflow' (and 'overflow-x'/'overflow-y'). It is not specified how this works.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#the-textarea-element-2",
